 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good afternoon. How would you like me to call you, Finn, or Mr Gallagher? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Finn is fine, thank you, doctor. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "And I'm Aoife, I look after him after school. His mum's at work. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Lovely. Finn, you're here for your follow-up after the sore throat. How's it been? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Better, thanks. My throat's been sore for about three days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Five days, Finn. It was before the weekend, I'd say five at least."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So between three and five days, we'll say. And is it still sore?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A little bit, when I swallow. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever since the antibiotic started?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "No, nothing. His temperature's been normal, I checked."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And what's he taking, Aoife?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Amoxicillin, 10 ml, three times a day. And paracetamol syrup when he needs it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's 5 ml. I measure it myself."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "It's 10, Finn, I've the bottle here and I do it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Two different amounts, so I'll check the prescription. Finn, have you had any problems like this before?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He's had tonsillitis three times this year."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Grommets in his ears when he was three."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right, let me have a look. Open wide and say ahh.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ahh. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The tonsils are much less red and swollen than last time."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is that good? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Very good. And I can't see any white patches on them now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Can I go back to school? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Once you're eating and drinking normally and you've finished the antibiotic, yes. I think the tonsillitis is clearing up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Does he need anything else? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not at the moment. If it doesn't settle by the end of the course, I might do a throat swab."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "That's fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Make sure he finishes all of the amoxicillin, even when he feels well."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I will. ~"
  }
